{"3942110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Memory Cosmos", "steam_appid": 3942110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About This Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>(This product is still under development. Current version: 0.1001)</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently available content includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Knowledge Galaxy</strong> → <strong>Chinese Fundamentals Nebula</strong> → <strong>Mandatory Chinese Knowledge Planet</strong> → <strong>Chinese Required Poetry &amp; Prose Memory Continent</strong> → <strong>Elementary School Required Poetry &amp; Prose Memory Province</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Knowledge Galaxy</strong> → <strong>Foreign Language Fundamentals Galaxy</strong> → <strong>English Fundamentals Planet</strong> → <strong>English Vocabulary Memory Continent</strong> → <strong>High School English Vocabulary Memory Province</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grand Master Nebula</strong> → <strong>Ge Wu Zhi Zhi (Investigation of Things) System</strong> → <strong>Daoist Texts Planet</strong> → <strong>Voyage Continent</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of three playable levels are open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942110/extras/d9b4ae27965f7ae4cc4248a4a9dd981a.avif?t=1785400708\" width=1270 height=736 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knowledge Stellification:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classics, poetry and other knowledge are restructured into a dynamic cosmic structure - from the &quot;Grand Master Galaxy&quot; to the &quot;Inquiry into Things and Acquisition of Knowledge Star System&quot;, delving deeper layer by layer for exploration. Each planet represents an independent knowledge module (such as a chapter of &quot;The Art of War by Sun Tzu&quot;), and spatial coordinates are used for positioning to enhance memory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Learning Engine:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Free Exploration: WASD movement + mouse for perspective control, wander among knowledge planets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knowledge Blackboard: Displays original text, pinyin, and annotation explanations (as shown in the following figure)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942110/extras/b7feb80ecefe660092638d26a19f8746.avif?t=1785400708\" width=1270 height=736 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Data-driven: Smart tables dynamically manage massive amounts of text to ensure precise content updates (as shown in the following figure).<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942110/extras/628fae1910f4cd4bd697b6e2073274b0.avif?t=1785400708\" width=1270 height=736 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cognitive training system:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on spatial memory algorithms, it associates abstract knowledge with three-dimensional coordinates to enhance memory efficiency.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942110/extras/70ffd4c6a721d61216fc95c54b5ab098.avif?t=1785400708\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future Vision: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will build a &quot;knowledge universe&quot; - in the future, users will be able to customize knowledge planets, share learning maps, and eventually form a decentralized cognitive network. Join this cognitive revolution and make learning a journey across the stars!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About This Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>(This product is still under development. Current version: 0.1001)</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently available content includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Knowledge Galaxy</strong> → <strong>Chinese Fundamentals Nebula</strong> → <strong>Mandatory Chinese Knowledge Planet</strong> → <strong>Chinese Required Poetry &amp; Prose Memory Continent</strong> → <strong>Elementary School Required Poetry &amp; Prose Memory Province</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Knowledge Galaxy</strong> → <strong>Foreign Language Fundamentals Galaxy</strong> → <strong>English Fundamentals Planet</strong> → <strong>English Vocabulary Memory Continent</strong> → <strong>High School English Vocabulary Memory Province</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grand Master Nebula</strong> → <strong>Ge Wu Zhi Zhi (Investigation of Things) System</strong> → <strong>Daoist Texts Planet</strong> → <strong>Voyage Continent</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of three playable levels are open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942110/extras/d9b4ae27965f7ae4cc4248a4a9dd981a.avif?t=1785400708\" width=1270 height=736 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knowledge Stellification:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classics, poetry and other knowledge are restructured into a dynamic cosmic structure - from the &quot;Grand Master Galaxy&quot; to the &quot;Inquiry into Things and Acquisition of Knowledge Star System&quot;, delving deeper layer by layer for exploration. Each planet represents an independent knowledge module (such as a chapter of &quot;The Art of War by Sun Tzu&quot;), and spatial coordinates are used for positioning to enhance memory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Learning Engine:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Free Exploration: WASD movement + mouse for perspective control, wander among knowledge planets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knowledge Blackboard: Displays original text, pinyin, and annotation explanations (as shown in the following figure)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942110/extras/b7feb80ecefe660092638d26a19f8746.avif?t=1785400708\" width=1270 height=736 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Data-driven: Smart tables dynamically manage massive amounts of text to ensure precise content updates (as shown in the following figure).<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942110/extras/628fae1910f4cd4bd697b6e2073274b0.avif?t=1785400708\" width=1270 height=736 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cognitive training system:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on spatial memory algorithms, it associates abstract knowledge with three-dimensional coordinates to enhance memory efficiency.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942110/extras/70ffd4c6a721d61216fc95c54b5ab098.avif?t=1785400708\" width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future Vision: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will build a &quot;knowledge universe&quot; - in the future, users will be able to customize knowledge planets, share learning maps, and eventually form a decentralized cognitive network. Join this cognitive revolution and make learning a journey across the stars!</p>", "short_description": "Can't remember? Wrong method. We turned 2500-yr-old memory palace into a game &quot;Memory Universe.&quot; Spatial &amp; visual anchors engrave knowledge—close eyes, walk to library &amp; see shelf words. We memorized 100k chars/mo, 99% recall. Early DEMO. Not sure? 9-Layer Dao Path Star Chart maps your life growth.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942110/6e9a5031a136522cd74a1ff15072658ac6497d15/header.jpg?t=1785400708", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942110/49faafabf6b055e301318bf68b29b876b15115f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785400708", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942110/49faafabf6b055e301318bf68b29b876b15115f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785400708", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> win7/win10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400 or AMD FX 8320<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["广州道庭科技工作室", "桂平虚幻科技工作室"], "publishers": ["广州道庭科技工作室"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "37", "description": "Free To Play"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.